## Original work in this repository

Everything in this repository not listed above — the DSH plugin, its tests,
scripts and documentation — is original to this project and carries the same
GPL-3.0-or-later license.
`src/setup.js` reimplements upstream's install layout
(`unity_bridge/plugin.rs`, `PLUGIN_DEFAULT_INSTALL_DIR` = `Packages/com.farlocus.locus`,
legacy `Assets/Locus`) so a package installed here is one the desktop client
also recognises.

`src/pipe-name.js` is a deliberate line-by-line reimplementation of the naming
scheme in `crates/locus-native-protocol/src/names.rs`; it must stay
byte-compatible with it so both sides derive the same endpoint.
